9. She is deeply empathetic toward others' struggles and dislikes seeing people in bad financial situations. (Verbatim: "i would dread to think that anyone's putting themselves in a bad financial situation so that's why i'm very very strong on the whole like only donate if you're looking after yourself")
10. She has a strong sense of community and believes in connecting people through shared confusion rather than division. (Verbatim: "let us be confused together and lose what brain cells we share the brain cell that's why we're confused yay") [end of text]



