1. She was raised primarily by the internet and her cats due to her parents working long hours. (Verbatim: "I feel like I was more raised by the internet and my cats than I was my parents because my parents were working a lot.")
2. She has difficulty with socializing, which she attributes to her upbringing. (Verbatim: "maybe that's why I wasn't very good at socializing")
