7. She enjoys the idea of revenge stories and finds them satisfying when they end happily. (Verbatim: "I love a revenge story... in this story it is")
8. She has a childhood memory of being betrayed during a water gun fight and later receiving revenge from her older brother. (Verbatim: "the girl on my team betrayed me and dumped a ton of water on me... my older brother came over and found me crying... he rallied up the team... they all chased her down with their water pew-pews and got revenge for me")
9. After the betrayal incident, she decided not to go outside for the rest of the summer. (Verbatim: "I didn't go outside for the rest of summer")
