10. She has a strong emotional connection to her fans, expressing that she missed them "more" and "heck and more". (Verbatim: "I'm so happy you're back, Eddie. Missed you. Missed you more. Missed you heck and more.") [end of text]



1. She has a dog named Lila who is highly attention-seeking and becomes upset if not given attention. (Verbatim: "she's very much a give me attention kind of dog and very much a gets upset if you don't give her attention kind of dog")
2. Her dog once brought dirty underwear to a maintenance worker during a home visit, causing significant embarrassment. (Verbatim: "she ran back she ran to the living room bringing that with her and i was like oh i can die just dying just absolutely dying")
3. She previously worked as a developer before becoming a VTuber. (Verbatim: "a lot of that I was I had my developer job so I've already paid taxes on that")
4. She pays taxes in the UK, specifically for the tax year April 2022 to April 2023. (Verbatim: "it's from like April 2022 to April 2023 so a lot of that I was I had my developer job")
5. She humorously claims she doesn't need to pay taxes before she was born, referencing her VTuber persona. (Verbatim: "surely I should just say that to them I'll be like dear HMRC I was not born therefore no taxes")
6. She once confused the IRS with Ireland and the Irish Republican Army due to similar acronyms. (Verbatim: "for the longest time i thought irs was like ireland i'm really hoping someone else thought that as well")
